  "description": "Dig in to every berm on your way down. You earned your turns by crushing the climb on your Shift R7, engineered with Haro's 4-Bar Linkage frame and Rockshox 120mm+ front and rear suspension, an advanced \"less-is-more\" 1x11 drivetrain, and sealed-bearing 12 mm through axle rear hub. Complete the build with lighter, faster, FSA and Ritchey components, to give you full commitment specs for your full-commitment ride.\n6061-T6 alloy 4-Bar linkage frame, 125mm rear travel, tapered 1.5\" head tube, 73mm BB shell, 12mm thru-axle dropouts\nRockShox Monarch RL Solo Air rear shock w/ rebound adjuster and lockout\nRockshox Recon Gold RL 27.5 fork, Solo Air; 120mm travel, w/ remote lockout\nRitchey Comp Logic Zero Press-Fit 1-1/8\" / 1.5\" headset\nNew FSA V-Drive Modular crankset w/ 32T Megatooth alloy chainring\nNew Shimano SLX 1x11-spd rear derailleur, Shadow Plus\nNew Shimano SLX 1x11 shifter & 11-spd 11-42T cassette\nWTB Rocket Comp saddle\nRitchey Trail alloy cockpit w/ Trail WCS Lock-Ring grips",
